            "text3": "Hold the device flush against your skin at a 90° angle and press the button to activate the light pulse. Move the device in a slow, sweeping motion to treat each area evenly.",
            "text4": "Flash an area no more than 3 times in a single session to avoid irritation.",
            "video": "shopify://files/videos/A10 Step 4.mov"
          }
        }
      },
